  "remarks": "Mikhail Shmoilov is the General Director of Federal State Budgetary Institution OK “Snegiri”, a Russian entity which runs a wellness and health centre in the Moscow Region and is owned by the Office of the President of the Russian Federation. In cooperation with the Communist Party of the Russian Federation, he organises trips where children from illegally occupied territories of Ukraine undergo Russian patriotic education and military training. Therefore, Mikhail Shmoilov is supporting and implementing policies contributing to the forced assimilation and militarised education of Ukrainian minors.",
